@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### first cursor page (default sort: newest first)
# @capture nextCursor = $.pagination.nextCursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2

### second cursor page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&cursor={{nextCursor}}

### cursor cannot be combined with offset
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&cursor={{nextCursor}}&offset=2

### totals are only offered for offset pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&cursor={{nextCursor}}&includeTotal=true

### a tampered cursor is rejected
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2&cursor=not-a-real-cursor
